{"seq":4,"slug":"lc0060-permutation-sequence","title":"LeetCode 60 排列序列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-backtracking-string/lc0060-permutation-sequence","wordCount":760,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-60-排列序列\">LeetCode 60 排列序列</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定整数 n 和 k，返回集合 <code>[1, 2, 3, ..., n]</code> 的所有排列中，按字典序排列的第 k 个排列。</p>\n<p><strong>示例：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：n = 3, k = 3&#10;输出：&quot;213&quot;&#10;解释：[1,2,3] 的全排列按字典序为：&#10;  &quot;123&quot;, &quot;132&quot;, &quot;213&quot;, &quot;231&quot;, &quot;312&quot;, &quot;321&quot;&#10;第 3 个排列是 &quot;213&quot;&#10;&#10;输入：n = 4, k = 9&#10;输出：&quot;2314&quot;&#10;&#10;输入：n = 3, k = 1&#10;输出：&quot;123&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：n = 3, k = 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：\"213\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：[1,2,3] 的全排列按字典序为：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"123\", \"132\", \"213\", \"231\", \"312\", \"321\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>第 3 个排列是 \"213\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输入：n = 4, k = 9</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：\"2314\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输入：n = 3, k = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：\"123\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= n &lt;= 9</code></li>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= k &lt;= n!</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>暴力方法是生成所有 n! 个排列然后取第 k 个，但 n=9 时有 362880 个排列，效率极低。</p>\n<p><strong>数学方法（阶乘数系统）：</strong> 关键洞察是利用阶乘来确定每一位的数字。对于 n 个数的排列，固定第一位后，后面 n-1 个数有 <code>(n-1)!</code> 种排列。因此第 k 个排列的第一位数字可以通过 <code>k / (n-1)!</code> 直接计算得出。</p>\n<p>以 n=4, k=9 为例（使用 0-indexed，即 k=8）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>候选数字：<code>[1, 2, 3, 4]</code>，<code>3! = 6</code></li>\n<li>第 1 位：<code>8 / 6 = 1</code>，选第 1 个数字 <code>2</code>，剩余 <code>[1, 3, 4]</code>，<code>k = 8 % 6 = 2</code></li>\n<li>第 2 位：<code>2 / 2 = 1</code>，选第 1 个数字 <code>3</code>，剩余 <code>[1, 4]</code>，<code>k = 2 % 2 = 0</code></li>\n<li>第 3 位：<code>0 / 1 = 0</code>，选第 0 个数字 <code>1</code>，剩余 <code>[4]</code>，<code>k = 0 % 1 = 0</code></li>\n<li>第 4 位：剩余 <code>4</code></li>\n</ol>\n<p>结果：<code>&quot;2314&quot;</code>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>暴力枚举全排列</td>\n<td>O(n! × n)</td>\n<td>O(n! × n)</td>\n<td>生成所有排列后取第 k 个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回溯+计数跳过</td>\n<td>O(n² )</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>利用阶乘跳过整段排列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阶乘数系统</td>\n<td>O(n²)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>直接计算每一位，最优</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>阶乘数系统的本质是将 k-1 转换为阶乘进制数。普通十进制每一位的权重是 10 的幂，而阶乘进制第 i 位的权重是 i!。这种表示天然对应排列的字典序位置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function getPermutation(n: number, k: number): string {&#10;  const factorials: number[] = [1];&#10;  for (let i = 1; i &lt; n; i++) {&#10;    factorials[i] = factorials[i - 1] * i;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const candidates: number[] = [];&#10;  for (let i = 1; i &lt;= n; i++) {&#10;    candidates.push(i);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  k--;&#10;&#10;  let result = &#39;&#39;;&#10;  for (let i = n - 1; i &gt;= 0; i--) {&#10;    const idx = Math.floor(k / factorials[i]);&#10;    result += candidates[idx];&#10;    candidates.splice(idx, 1);&#10;    k %= factorials[i];&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getPermutation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> factorials</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    factorials[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> factorials[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> candidates</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    candidates.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(i);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">--</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">--</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> idx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">floor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> factorials[i]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> candidates[idx];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    candidates.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">splice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(idx, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> factorials[i];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>实现要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>k 转为 0-indexed</strong>：<code>k--</code> 将 1-indexed 转为 0-indexed，便于除法和取模运算。例如第 1 个排列对应 k=0。</li>\n<li><strong>阶乘预计算</strong>：<code>factorials[i] = i!</code>，自底向上计算。<code>factorials[0] = 0! = 1</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>候选数组</strong>：维护一个有序数组存储尚未使用的数字。每确定一位就通过 <code>splice</code> 移除对应数字。</li>\n<li><strong>逐位确定</strong>：对于第 <code>i</code> 位（从高位到低位），<code>idx = Math.floor(k / (i)!)</code> 是当前位在候选数组中的下标，<code>k %= (i)!</code> 更新剩余偏移量。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><code>splice</code> 操作的时间复杂度为 O(n)，总共执行 n 次，因此总时间复杂度为 O(n²)。若使用树状数组或线段树维护候选集，可以将单次操作优化到 O(log n)，总时间降至 O(n log n)，但对于 n ≤ 9 的约束来说没有必要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间</td>\n<td>O(n²)</td>\n<td>外层循环 n 次，每次 <code>splice</code> 为 O(n)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>阶乘数组和候选数组各 O(n)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>本题的核心价值在于阶乘数系统的思想。这个概念在组合数学中有广泛应用：Lehmer 编码将排列映射为唯一整数，可用于排列的压缩存储和快速索引。在竞赛中遇到&quot;第 k 个排列&quot;或&quot;排列的字典序排名&quot;问题时，阶乘数系统是标准工具。</p>\n<p>相关问题的逆操作——给定一个排列求其字典序排名——同样可以用阶乘数系统解决：从高位到低位，统计每一位左侧比它小的未使用数字个数，乘以对应的阶乘权重，累加即为排名。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 60 排列序列","id":"leetcode-60-排列序列"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 52 N 皇后 II","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-backtracking-string/lc0052-n-queens-ii"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 28 KMP 字符串匹配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-backtracking-string/lc0028-kmp-implementation"}}